<title>USA: Spiegel's Eddie Bauer January sales up.</title>
<headline>Spiegel's Eddie Bauer January sales up.</headline>
<dateline>DOWNERS GROVE, Ill. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spiegel Inc said Thursday comparable-store sales for its Eddie Bauer subsidiary increased seven percent in January from a year ago.</p>
<p>Spiegel reported its total sales for the four weeks ended January 25, 1997 of $177.5 million, up four percent from sales of $171.3 million for the same period last year.</p>
<p>January sales were driven by continued strength in its Eddie Bauer division, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
